  Test de l'ecart beneficiaires/non-beneficiaires (p-valeurs) :

. foreach v in dim_assai dim_eau dim_logem dim_nutri dim_sante dim_protect ///
>              dim_educ pauvre_MODA {
  2.     quietly regress `v' D if t == 0, vce(cluster grappe)
  3.     local p0 = 2*ttail(e(df_r), abs(_b[D]/_se[D]))
  4.     quietly regress `v' D if t == 1, vce(cluster grappe)
  5.     local p1 = 2*ttail(e(df_r), abs(_b[D]/_se[D]))
